    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3c70212a-22d3-5f43-9970-1e2291aafce3" activityNameId="15af90fe-7787-58c5-9d40-a862503dae38" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="1">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, high pressure, at consumer</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, high pressure, at consumer
Total network losses are based on published data, repartition of losses on high and low pressure network on calculations with data for other countries.;
Synonyms: Kompogas, Naturgas; 
UUID: e68512db-8243-3bfb-b026-d378e9b9e248
This dataset describes the energy requirement and the emissions of the high pressure distribution network in Switzerland.
Location: Energy requirements is based on environmental report of Italian company. Total leakages are specific for CH, HD-leakages are calculated out of the total with German data.
Technology: The quantity of gas delivered in the high and medium pressure network is estimated. Industry, power plants and half of commercial and of others are assumed to be connected to the high and medium pressure network .
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 20 PJ natural gas at 39 MJ/m3 in high and medium pressure network
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e68512db-8243-3bfb-b026-d378e9b9e248.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
